<title>
Shift Paddle Switch Inspection
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disable air bag system. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A8206001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove driver air bag (inflator) module from steering wheel. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A8206006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect steering switch connector (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check for continuity between terminals of steering switch connector.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Replace steering wheel assembly if check result is not as specified.
</ptxt>
